      en: ["The city was officially established on November 1, 1958.", "The original name Ka'arendy means 'shining yerba mate field' in Guaraní.", "Mallorquín is located about 65 kilometers west of Ciudad del Este.", "The settlement was elevated to the status of a district in 1968.", "The local economy is driven by the production of soy, corn, and wheat.", "The name honors Juan León Mallorquín, a defender of Paraguayan sovereignty."],
